---
// src/components/CtaBanner.astro
---
<div class="cta-banner-container" data-aos="fade-up">
  <div class="cta-card">
    <div class="cta-content">
      <h2>Descubrí qué podría automatizar tu empresa.</h2>
      <p>Analizamos tus procesos actuales sin costo y te mostramos el potencial real de IA para tu negocio.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-green" data-open-quote>
        Solicitar cotización
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-robot-visual">
      <div class="glow-bg"></div>
      <img src="/images/Robot.png" alt="Agente de IA MM SmartInbox" class="robot-cta" />
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .cta-banner-container {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #071548 0%, #0b2591 100%);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 3rem 3.5rem;
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(7, 21, 72, 0.25);
  }

  .cta-content {
    max-width: 550px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .cta-content h2 {
    font-size: 2.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
  }

  .cta-content p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .btn-green {
    background-color: #15c63b;
    color: white;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(21, 198, 59, 0.35);
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .btn-green:hover {
    background-color: #12ad33;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(21, 198, 59, 0.45);
  }

  .cta-robot-visual {
    position: relative;
    width: 200px;
    height: 180px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .glow-bg {
    position: absolute;
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(21, 198, 59, 0.3) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(15px);
  }

  .robot-cta {
    width: 160px;
    height: auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3));
    animation: floatCta 3.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes floatCta {
    0% { transform: translateY(0); }
    100% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .cta-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.8rem;
    }
    .cta-content {
      max-width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .cta-content h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    .cta-robot-visual {
      width: 150px;
      height: 140px;
    }
    .robot-cta {
      width: 130px;
    }
  }
</style>
